    Remove deprecated REST endpoint POST /assets/add (#8334)
    
    The endpoint has been deprecated since before Opencast 5.0 in favor of
    POST /assets/snapshot. It was only an alias that called snapshot() with
    the same parameter, and nothing in Opencast uses it anymore.
    
